This repository is licensed per file, following the REUSE convention
(https://reuse.software). REUSE.toml and the SPDX headers in the files are
authoritative; the licence texts are in LICENSES/.

  kernel/patches/, kernel/config/     GPL-2.0-only
      Changes to the Linux kernel. Each patch keeps its author (From:) and
      sign-offs; kernel/PROVENANCE.md records where each one comes from.

  helper/                             GPL-3.0-or-later
      helper/crates/sp9-digitizer and sp9-digitizerd are derived from
      iptsd (GPL-2.0-or-later); the files that are say so in their headers.

  userspace/iptsd/*.patch             GPL-2.0-or-later
      Changes to iptsd, under iptsd's licence.

  userspace/libcamera/*.patch         LGPL-2.1-or-later, BSD-2-Clause, CC0-1.0
      Changes to libcamera, each under the licence of the libcamera files
      it changes (REUSE.toml lists them per patch).

  userspace/ (everything else),       MIT
  tools/, nix/, flake.nix,
  flake.lock, .github/

  Documentation: every *.md file      CC-BY-SA-4.0
  and docs/ (including the            Code and commands quoted inside the
  reference data in docs/reference/)  documents may also be used under MIT.

